# Sample of remediated vulnerabilities — investigation

## Overview

Pulled all `state=fixed` Dependabot alerts org-wide via `gh api` for the SOC 2 observation window (alerts span Jun 2025 – Apr 2026, single repo `normainofficial/normain`). 105 fixed alerts total: 4 Critical, 50 High, 37 Medium, 14 Low. Filtered High+Critical (n=54) into a CSV sample matching Vanta evidence-request fields (CVE, severity, repo, package, opened, remediated, alert URL). Existing Vanta doc version (Apr 30, 2026) is a single screenshot referencing PR #1986 / NOR-2603 — replacing/augmenting with a structured CSV strengthens audit evidence ahead of next-week audit start.

## Situation — Vanta requirements

Source: Vanta doc `/c/normain.com/documents/vulnerabilities-remediated-sample` (Instructions tab).

- **Scope**: high-severity findings from the most recent periodic vulnerability scan
