- **Format**: tickets or report aggregating closed high-sev findings, audit-ready
- **Frameworks mapped**: ISO 27001:2022, SOC 2
- **Time sensitivity**: upload during SOC 2 observation window
- **Recurrence**: renew quarterly (next renew: Jul 30, 2026)
- **Current Vanta status**: OK (latest version submitted 2026-04-30 by Kalle, single screenshot ref'ing PR #1986)

